<title>FINLAND: ALL HELIBOR INTEREST RATES STEADY AT FIX.</title>
<headline>ALL HELIBOR INTEREST RATES STEADY AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>All Helibor interest rates</p>
<p>were unchanged at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Monday.</p>
<p>The three-month rate was 3.07 percent.</p>
<p>			  March 10 fix	  March 7 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor	   3.03 pct		3.03 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor	   3.05 pct		3.05 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor	   3.07 pct		3.07 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor	   3.16 pct		3.16 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor	   3.25 pct		3.25 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	  3.35 pct		3.35 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
</text>
